ea. You can smell it when you walk in the door. One of these days I will get some on the way home from work."},{"business_id":"HtSM1dtabFtzCOLphKms-w","review_id":"leafVkMlYM0Dbt_J59EPKA","date":"2012-03-13T01:15:12","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9394299983978271,"text_excerpt":"I really thought I'd reviewed this place already. As some may know, getting a 5 star review off of me is as easy as getting a 100% truthful answer from a politician. But I have to admit, this little hole in the wall place not only has some of the best crawfish I've ever eaten, they do the best gumbo I've had that I didn't make myself. Not only do they do great food, their prices are outstanding. Their shrimp platter (and any platter really) is too big to eat at one sitting. And they don't mind subbing their awesome onion rings for fries. But the portions are so large they have to put tape on the container to keep it most of the way closed. This place probably does 90% take-away. It's smal..."},{"business_id":"HtSM1dtabFtzCOLphKms-w","review_id":"quemffvOq_wofc-MFtZ-4Q","date":"2021-05-29T23:52:56","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9138628244400024,"text_excerpt":"Seafood Zone has the best gumbo i've had since I moved out here! It's loaded with chicken, sausage and shrimp. It's always hot and fresh and everything is made to order."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"HtSM1dtabFtzCOLphKms-w","photo_id":"PcwGplF---ckgCihrJbf2w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/PcwGplF---ckgCihrJbf2w.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
